Package: typist
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jakub <jakubtom@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-evdev, python3-numpy, pipewire | pulseaudio-utils
Recommends: python3-sounddevice
Description: Ulanzi Vibe Key AU05 Driver & Voice Typing Assistant
 Typist is a driver and speech-to-text dictation client for the Ulanzi AU05
 keypad. It captures the AU05 voice key, streams microphone audio to local or
 remote Whisper STT models, and emulates native keystrokes via Linux uinput.
